  "title": "Baked Brie with Maple Caramelized Apples and Spiced Praline Bacon",
  "description": "Baked Brie with maple caramelized apples and spiced praline bacon is a creamy, smoky, spicy, and sweet appetizer recipe — it&#39;s a party in your mouth.",
  "authors": [
