  "ingredients": [
    "3 slices bacon",
    "2 tablespoons finely chopped pecans",
    "1 tablespoon brown sugar",
    "1 teaspoon chili powder",
    "sea salt to taste",
    "2 tablespoons unsalted butter",
    "2 Golden Delicious apples - peeled, cored, and cut into 1/2-inch thick slices",
    "3 tablespoons pure maple syrup",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 (8 ounce) round Brie cheese",
    "1 teaspoon chopped fresh rosemary"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Line a baking sheet with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gkrnRJbTBOQA5_q2UXFLJlQb1S0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260561-baked-brie-with-maple-caramelized-apples-and-spiced-praline-bacon-VAT-step-01-666023c85c1145ec914441c25eb53bcc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260561/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay bacon strips in a single layer on the prepared baking sheet. Combine pecans, brown sugar, chili powder, and sea salt in a bowl; evenly sprinkle over bacon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pgGCDyRWbnAugerFGK7BAbnaUuw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260561-baked-brie-with-maple-caramelized-apples-and-spiced-praline-bacon-VAT-step-02-c228c586732c474e90622a995cd8a4d2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260561/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until browned and crisp, 18 to 20 minutes. Transfer to a rack to cool. Chop bacon into rough pieces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/k1XbcmHUJoUMXmHbfFo9Pdekk2c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260561-baked-brie-with-maple-caramelized-apples-and-spiced-praline-bacon-VAT-step-03-2-b6b1806757524ebdaf293795c706c5c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260561/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a nonstick skillet over medium-high heat. Add apples and 1 tablespoon maple syrup; sauté, stirring only every 60 to 90 seconds, until apples are tender and brown, about 8 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7qWBdpJLq5wSW9H0_2Z7oBtlj8E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260561-baked-brie-with-maple-caramelized-apples-and-spiced-praline-bacon-VAT-step-04-a24282047ab74cdcb0dbe4d2f31e1b5a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260561/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in remaining 2 tablespoons maple syrup and cinnamon; transfer to a bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CkI1kx_VFd4ZHeEfvItafrbDuNM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260561-baked-brie-with-maple-caramelized-apples-and-spiced-praline-bacon-VAT-step-05-89fc623275b343dca975df1d183a3b10.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260561/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut a round of parchment paper slightly larger than the round of Brie cheese; place onto a baking sheet. Place Brie on the parchment round; top with apples, making a big mound.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rZDXZM1A7zz73Gwd_KPO5Bjdvo8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260561-baked-brie-with-maple-caramelized-apples-and-spiced-praline-bacon-VAT-step-06-c872342a347047eb995abe85210f742d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260561/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 5 minutes. Add bacon-praline mixture on top of Brie; continue baking until top is bubbly, 2 to 3 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f7CSVJrY3lLtHrXWOTqXNJhaOoo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260561-baked-brie-with-maple-caramelized-apples-and-spiced-praline-bacon-VAT-step-07-60df6371324e40aab6d34b6eaeab9e2e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260561/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a serving platter using a large spatula; sprinkle with sea salt and rosemary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j2eNjkLKeM_zR1oYNwUxXzHw2Uo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-260561-baked-brie-with-maple-caramelized-apples-and-spiced-praline-bacon-VAT-4x3-2pulledback-23e27d0160bf4e98b24edfb936b16b74.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/260561/step_08.webp"
    }
